window.products.push({"id":225010,"name":"Topwit Electric Kettle, Electric Tea Kettle with Automatic Sprinkling for Tea-brewing, Keep Warm and Dual Modes Electric Tea Maker, 1L Pour Over Teapo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hM3zuwjsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍵Steam Extraction Brewing Method - Topwit professional electric tea maker gives you a new experience of brewing different types of tea. No need to make tea in the complicated methods. When the water is rolling boil, the water comes up from the bottom through the tube and sprinkle on the tea-leaf in the infuser. As this process goes on, tea will slowly drip from the infuser into the tea kettle, extracting the pure flavor of the tea in minutes. 🍵Dual Modes Design - The electric tea kettle feature dual modes of making tea. When the switch stays at \"AUTO\", it heats the water to rolling boil and stays for 5-10 mins. After that, the glass kettle will shut off for a while. As the temperature drops, it will heat again. Please rotate the switch to “OFF” to turn off the kettle when not in use. While it’s at MANUEL\", it keeps boiling water, it’s convenient for you to control the tea boiling time to get your desired flavor. 🍵Food Grade Material - The body of the electric tea maker is made of food grade borosilicate glass and the infuser is made of 304 stainless steel. The electric tea kettle is BPA-free. Borosilicate glass is resistant to thermal shock and beautifully showcase the color of your tea. The food grade stainless steel infuser can separate the tea leaf from the water efficiently. 🍵Easy to Clean - The glass gooseneck kettle wide opening design and the removable stainless steel infuser allow you to easily clean the inside of the kettle, fill water and tea-leaf. ❤Tips: Please do not pour over all the water immediately after boiling, the residual heat from the heating coil would keep heating the stainless steel bottom. To clean the tea kettle regularly with a WHITE VINEGAR can remove the limescale spots/tea stains. 🍵Human-oriented Design - The gooseneck spout design is easy to control the water flow for pouring over the tea precisely and steadily. The kettle handle is made of thickening borosilicate glass which gives you a safe-touch while pouring. The LED light adds more fun while making tea.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hM3zuwjsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TopWit","source_asin":"B095SHWW2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095SHWW2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095SHWW2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
