window.products.push({"id":225068,"name":"Camping Fridge 26.4 Quart/27L，Mini Refrigerator Electric Cooler and Warmer for Car and house with Dual 12V DC & 110V AC Thermoelectric System Portable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tYe0WjGWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Introductions: Switch from heating to cooling. The thermoelectric system allows for easy switching from beverage cooler to food warmer! Ideal size for use at home, in the nursery, office or dorm room – Mom's love the ability to keep milk or formula at the right temperature. Bring your lunch to work in the morning and keep it hot all day. Change from cooling to heating with the flip of a switch! Features: 1. Refrigerate and heat. ZOKOP mini fridge has the switch from heating to cooling. Cooling capacity: 32.4ºF below ambient temperature. Warming capacity: 140ºF-149ºF. When cooling, the green indicator on, when heating, the red indicator on 2. AC/DC adapters included. Easy to go from indoor 120V (AC) to car use by plugging the appliance into the car cigarette 12V (DC) adapter. Also great for use on boats, RVs and while camping or picnicking 3. Super quiet. No worry for noises, too quiet when working to make you notice it 4. Reasonable design. The size of mini fridge is easy for carrying: （16.14*12.6*16.93）\" 5. Widely use and portable. There is a handle on the top of the fridge for your convenience. It can use in car / home / office, and on the boats Specifications: 1. Material: PP 2. Capacity: 26L/0.92cuft 3. Input voltage(AC): 120V 4. Power(AC): Cool 60W,Warm 50W 5. Input Voltage(DC): 12V 6. Power(DC): Cool 55W,Warm 45W 7. Color: Blue 8. Dimensions: (16.14 x 12.6 x 16.93 )\" / (41 x 32 x 43)cm (L x W x H) 9. Weight: 176.37oz / 5000g 10. Brand: ZOKOP Package Includes: 1 x 26L Mini Fridge Cooler and Warmer 1 x Handle 1 x Handle Mounting Accessories 1 x Cigarette Lighter Plug 1 x 120V Power Supply Plug 1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tYe0WjGWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MTFY","source_asin":"B07T4GH37C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T4GH37C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T4GH37C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
