window.products.push({"id":225175,"name":"Madison Park Celeste 4 Piece 2-in-1 Duvet Set, Pink, Cal King, King/California King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OofSCPEAL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Create a shabby chic look in your bedroom with the Madison Park Celeste collection. The 2-in-1 duvet cover has a quilted top and button closure providing the option to use as a lightweight coverlet by simply buttoning up the bottom or fill with a comforter insert for a warmer option. A duvet cover is a protective cover for your comforter, most likely for your down comforter. Sometimes it's referred to as a comforter cover. Duvet covers are not filled. It has an opening where you can insert your comforter. Filler not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OofSCPEAL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madison Park","source_asin":"B01B4NI5L2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B4NI5L2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B4NI5L2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":225176,"name":"SOSHU Throw Pillow Covers Tropical Summer Parrot Toucan Palm Leaves and Exotic Flowers Cushion Cases for Sofa Home Decorative Pillowcases Square Size ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61khnASFaXL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Package: 1-piece cushion pillow covers without pillow insert. You are suggested to use slightly bigger inserts for a fluffier look.Pillow case have sturdy invisible zipper, the wiring is tight,the stitches are delicate,and it is not easy to break, easy to clean and can be used for a long timeLots of styles to choose,to meet your different hobbies. Quality fabric non-toxic and harmless with the pattern is clear and bright let comfort and beauty coexistWash: Machine wash cold separately, gently cycle only, no bleach, tumble dry low, do not iron, low temperature if necessary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61khnASFaXL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOSHU","source_asin":"B08DXPXT3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DXPXT3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DXPXT3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":225177,"name":"Qualitas Beeswax 6-1/2-Ounce Candle, Vetiver Scented","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BV1stN83L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The scent of vetiver has been described by Indian poets as \"the smell of the first monsoon shower on parched soil.\" In summer, the vetiver plant's long, strong stems are woven into mats, hung in doorways, and sprayed with water to keep homes cool and wonderfully, subtly fragrant. Earthy, grassy, and rejuvenating, the tropical grass has been long known to perfumers—its essential oil is an ingredient of ninety percent of Western perfumes. Qualitas captures the ancient scent of welcome rain in a luxury beeswax candle. Light one to fill the air with the inimitable scent of magic vetiver.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BV1stN83L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qualitas Candles","source_asin":"B008MS35SG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008MS35SG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008MS35SG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":225178,"name":"Ytuomzi Pro Chef Knife – 8-inch Professional Chef Knife – German High-Carbon Stainless-Steel Knife with Durable Wooden Handle – Sharpener and Finger G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f9315lLbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE RIGHT FIT FOR YOU: Professional chef or amateur cook, everyone needs a high-quality multifunctional chef’s knife that allows them to prepare virtually any ingredient for delicious, tasty meals. Working with top professional in the field, we have designed the YTUOMZI chef knife in box, a superb German-made steel blade that will not let you down. THE QUALITY YOU HAVE BEEN LOOKING FOR: This extra sharp chef knife is crafted with 7CR17MOV German-imported steel, it is corrosion and discoloration-resistant and features durable carbon steel with 0.5%-0.65% carbon content, that means twice the carbon steel you usually get in a regular chef’s knife. Everything is stronger, more robust, and heavier. SHARP & PRECISE CUTTING ANGLE: Our German blade cooking knife features and ultra-sharp steel blade that you can re-sharpen with ease to make sure it’s always ready for action. Our pro chef’s knives are hand-polished by experienced craftsman, which ensures more sharpness for longer. The knives have a precise 15-degree cutting angle, so you enjoy even more sharpness and precision. ERGONOMIC DESIGN: This sharp kitchen knife was an ergonomic design that ensures more safety, as well as preventing hand fatigue and distress. It has an ideal balance between the handle weight and the sharp blade, so you can maneuver it with ease. The 8-inch chef knife is full tang, has no gap, and features a non-slip handle that ensures a better, more comfortable grip. FOR YOUR LOVED ONES: This stunning cooking knife is a lovely present option for a pro chef or an amateur cook. This nice chef knife comes in an elegant and luxurious box that is ready to be gifted. We have also included a practical knife sharpener, as well as a finger guard that makes this chef’s knife safer and easier to operate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f9315lLbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ytuomzi","source_asin":"B08FSTLJ99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FSTLJ99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FSTLJ99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
