window.products.push({"id":225205,"name":"Enamel Mug by Modern Retro! Camping Mug in 8 Vintage Enamelware Designs – Fun Metal Coffee Mug and Durable Camping Cup - Tin Mugs for Coffee (or Whisk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-fyb4bX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wake Up, And Smell The Nostalgia! What do longboards, Kombi’s and enamel all have in common? Perhaps like most, you guessed long carefree summer days listening to beach-themed music from the '60s! Ah, yes... the good ol’ days. Now, you may not have a time machine handy, but that’s ok because we’ve wrapped the era up in a range of retro enamel mugs for camping, work, or just to enhance your retro kitchen decor! ... A Big Day Needs a Big Drink! Some vintage mugs are oddly small, but if you remember the 60’s and 70’s you’ll already know how big these mugs were! Modern Retro Mugs are 16 oz, so you can make your own vintage ‘grande’ coffee, tea (...or something a li’l stronger) without any worries. They’re perfect for left and right-handed vintage lovers, too, because we’ve printed our retro designs on both sides! And there are 8 to choose from: Surfboards, Flip Flops, Bike, Phone, Glasses, Caravan, Kombi, or Camping. But of course, if you’re like the 56% of all people who struggle to decide, collecting this entire set makes sense too because they’re so affordable! Now, Take a Trip Down Memory Lane With Modern Retro Cold-rolled steel, enamel-coated metal coffee cup - stronger than ceramic! Cold-rolled steel, enamel-coated metal coffee cup - stronger than ceramic! Used as retro decor, camping mugs, adventure gifts or just to stare at in wanderlust! Used as retro decor, camping mugs, adventure gifts or just to stare at in wanderlust! Tailored packaging and perfect for gifting Tailored packaging and perfect for gifting With 12-Month Warranty With 12-Month Warranty As you probably know, back in the good ol’ days products just did their job they way they were supposed to - they didn’t break or become a burden. And we’re confident your Modern Retro enamel cup won’t give you any problems at all. But of course, contact us if you need us! So, go ahead, choose your favorite now and let's coffee like it’s 1969!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-fyb4bX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modern Retro","source_asin":"B07W864MVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W864MVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W864MVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
