window.products.push({"id":225237,"name":"Mokoya Soft Fleece Heated Throw Blanket 50\"x60\", Fast Heating Electric Throw Blanket with 10 Heat Levels, 2/4/6/8hrs Auto Off, Stitchless Reversible F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c5lvri5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Power & Heat Up Evenly】With the 120w high power design, Mokoya heated throw blanket will warm up immediately within 3-5 minutes at level 10. You can have instant warmth and get cozy in just a few minutes. It features 10 heating levels from 95°F to 149°F, you can find the warmth perfectly fits your needs. Also, Mokoya electric blankets all use high-quality Japan-manufactured heating wire, which is safer and much more stable, making the heating temperatures distributed evenly. 【Safety Is Our Priority】Mokoya heated blanket is made with double protective insulation and overheating protection, it will automatically shut off when overheated. Also, the electric blanket with auto-off timer (2, 4, 6, 8 hrs) gives additional safety to ensure the blanket never operated without supervision. Automatic power adjustment will make sure once the temperature reached the certain level, the power will drop to 0. Great for energy-saving! Pass ul, fcc, ce, and other safety tests. 【Stitchless Design&Ultra Soft Fabric】Unlike other brands' heated blankets, Mokoya fleece electric blanket has no wire construction stitches on the surface. More simple and elegant. The fleece heated blanket was double-sided by premium 300GSM flannel, extremely soft and skin-friendly, and also very practical reversible design. High-density fabric makes our fleece blanket more durable and comfortable, you will hardly feel the existence of the heating wire during use. Suitable for all seasons. 【For Your Convenience】The flannel electric blanket is equipped with a 15ft power cord, provides plenty of lengths connected to the outlets, and the 4ft controller cord can easily be reached and tucked away as well. Long enough to fit lots of scenarios. The 50x60 heated blanket throw is the perfect size for snuggling on the couch, sofa, or home office during the winter. Good lap blanket as well. Great gift for women, children, parents, and families. 【Easy Care & Machine Washable】No need to worry about the cleaning! For long-term use, you can use a laundry bag and follow the instructions. Disconnect the controller and power cables and place the blanket in the washer. Use cold water only and put it on a slow gentle cycle. Then move it to the dryer on low heat or let it air dry. Do not use bleach. Tested to stay soft after multiple washes. This is the electric blanket that can be used for years, you would not miss this one！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c5lvri5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mokoya","source_asin":"B0BF12YVSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF12YVSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF12YVSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
