window.products.push({"id":225292,"name":"Aydria Premium Flannel Fleece Blanket - Ultra-Soft, Lightweight and Plush – Luxurious and Cozy Fuzzy Blanket – Fluffy Blanket for Sofa, Bed, Chair for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GrNdtnHpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Aydria, our main priority is to transform your home into a sanctuary of warmth, freshness, and elegance where you can feel comfort at all times. Our products are made with 100% microfibre polyester, a super soft fabric that offers the right balance of softness and weight! It is designed to withstand washes without losing its softness. As fleece is an absorbent fabric, it keeps moisture away from the skin and leaves a layer of warm, dry air. One of the best features of this fleece blanket is its hypoallergenic properties, the material creates a breathable yet perfectly sealed barrier against allergens. The fleece blanket provides you with exceptional thermal insulation that protects you from the cold. It is the perfect solution for your indoor and outdoor use in cool/cold weathers. Selecting the right blanket depends on your individual needs and preferences. Based on our customer's feedback, we carefully handpicked the size and thickness of our fleece material to suit your various needs. Our 90 by 90 inches Aydria Blanket is the ideal ideal size for anyone using a super single, queen or king size bed. It is 300 GSM (Grams Per Square Metre) The higher the GSM, the warmer it keeps you! You could even safely curl up with Aydria Blanket and use it as a large throw while sipping a mug of hot chocolate! Care Instructions Machine Wash: Always wash your fleece blanket in cool/cold water on a gentle cycle to maintain its overlasting softness. Tumble Dry: Tumble dry your fleece blankets on gentle cycle with low heat. Do Not Bleach/No Intense Heat: Avoid using an iron over your blanket or using bleach or fabric softeners, as the chemicals will reduce the softness of the blanket over time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GrNdtnHpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A Y","source_asin":"B08YPBPFBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YPBPFBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YPBPFBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":225293,"name":"Summit Outdoor Wine Glasses, Vacuum Insulated Wine Tumbler With Lid, Stemless Metal Cup Design, Stainless Steel, Unbreakable, Shatterproof, Portable, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NCF8IR5SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Us: We are blessed to call Fort Collins, Colorado our home.  Our goal is to create products for all of the adventures that life may call you to - camping, climbing a 14er, or maybe just relaxing by a river.  We want these products to be durable, easy to clean, and also enhance whatever beverage you choose to consume. Thank you for investing in our products and we hope that you are able to slow down, fully savor life and enjoy everyday moments, wherever your journey may take you. Summit Legacy: To live life with wonder and awe and enjoy all of the adventures that you encounter, even the ones that challenge you and push you beyond your limits as you continue to climb towards your destination.  The goal isn't always about reaching the summit but what we learn along the way. When we are challenged, we become who we were created to be. Most people think of a legacy as physical things that we leave behind.  Legacy is our story.  How we live our life and how we complete the work that has been set out before us. The impact that we have on others, those that we love, and the people we have yet to meet, in a way that is positive, encouraging and motivating.  We are connected through our stories. Quality and Performance: Pro-grade 18/8 stainless steel to protect against flavor transfer Pro-grade 18/8 stainless steel to protect against flavor transfer Advanced vacuum insulated technology to keep your drink the perfect temperature longer Advanced vacuum insulated technology to keep your drink the perfect temperature longer No heat transfer or condensation to the outside of the glass No heat transfer or condensation to the outside of the glass Powder coated exterior to provide additional texture and durability Powder coated exterior to provide additional texture and durability Removable BPA free lid to protect against outdoor elements Removable BPA free lid to protect against outdoor elements","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NCF8IR5SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Summit Legacy Products","source_asin":"B07GY2J1JQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GY2J1JQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GY2J1JQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
