window.products.push({"id":225400,"name":"King Size Giza Sheet Set - Dreams Egyptian Giza Sheets King - Giza Bed Sheet Set Plum 100% Giza Cotton Soft Breathable Premium 19-Inch Extra Deep Pock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":93.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LsRJi9eCL._AC_SL1474_.jpg","description":"King Size 100% Giza Egyptian Cotton Sheet Set Dimension :- 1 Flat Sheet (102\" x 108\"), 1 Fitted Sheet (78\" x 80\") and 2 Pillow Cases (20\" x 40\"). Fitted sheet has elastic all around to stretch and fit snugly over mattresses up to 19-Inch deep. PURE QUALITY SHEETS: 100% Giza Egyptian Cotton, upscale design and soft bedding Set. It will create a welcoming environment and a restful feeling in your bedroom. It will provide you extra ordinary comfort and the best sleep experience ever. HIGHEST QUALITY GIZA EGYPTIAN COTTON SHEETS: New Better & Improved Version - If you love the luxury and durability of Hotel bed sheets and the look of crisp pillowcases, you’ll adore our Luxurious Sheets, We use yarns made with 100% long staple cotton fibre and a gorgeous sateen weave. Our eco-friendly sheets retain softness for a lifetime and resist fading. Indulge in soft bed sheets with detailed hem styling. LUXURY At Low Price: Imagine the quality of hotel linens with the perfection of handcrafted premium sheets, all at an incredible price. This is our promise. Our team of artisans measures each bed linen individually and stitches them to perfection. Our products also undergo extensive checks to ensure that your 100% cotton sheets will be defect-free, resistant to pilling and shrinking, and pure, just like industry-leading organic sheets COMPLETE BEDDING SET – This Egyptian Giza Cotton Sheet Set Includes 1 Fitted Sheet, 1 Flat Sheet, and 2 Matching Pillowcases to help you get the perfect look and feel from head to toe. Stunning Color, Luxury Style – Designed with natural, sustainable, and renewable resources.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LsRJi9eCL._AC_SL1474_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LuckShree","source_asin":"B09SHQ89HS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SHQ89HS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SHQ89HS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":225401,"name":"Sunny Home Moisture Absorbers Refill 2.2lbs (1 Pack) Fragrance Free for Home. Odor Eliminator, Dehumidifier, and Deodorizer for Closet, Bathroom, Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717Mo4xUcPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No dusting and fast dehumidification. Try SUNNY HOME Moisture Absorber refill! One Sunny Home refill (2.2 lbs) can fill 4 desiccant containers. Much more economical than buying the moisture absorber container over and over again. It also helps prevent overuse of plastic containers. Fast dehumidification This product is a beads type with Refined Calcium Chloride. Round beads type, that gone through refinement once more, quickly absorbs moisture with its large surface area compared to same amount of other dehumidifiers. Features A product that is easy to install and discard. It turns humid environment into dry and fresh with its powerful dehumidification feature. Also, it prevents odors with its deodorization feature. It removes musty smell and prevent it from spreading.Can be used for maximum 45 days.Authentic product manufactured by South Korea’s venture enterprise. A product that has gone through thorough product test with Household Chemicals Risk Assessment and Safety Standards tested by Korea Environmental Industry & Technology Institute. How to use 1. Throw away water in the used moisture absorber container. 2. Put about 250g(8.8oz) of refillable dehumidifier (bead type) in a container. 3. Use it with cover lid and, place the moisture absorber where you want. Applicable Place Basement, garage, closet, dressing room, kitchen, bathroom, shoe shelf, boat, car, etc. Cautions Do not use it for other purposes. Place the product on flat place to prevent the leakage when tumbled.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717Mo4xUcPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUNNY HOME","source_asin":"B09C7Z8T1D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C7Z8T1D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C7Z8T1D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
