window.products.push({"id":225415,"name":"Dry Erase Chalkboard Wall Calendar - 15\" x 11\" - Refrigerator Home & Kitchen Sticker Menu Board - Non Magnetic Reusable Chalk Board Vinyl Decal - Blac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613nSM6jJ8L._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"MULTIFUNCTIONAL & VERSATILE - Are you tired of waking up and not remember what you had planned for the day? This fun 15\" x 11\" calendar is ideal for people with high standards to create to-do lists, notes, meal prep, fitness tracking, reminders, event planning, chore coordinating, and preparing your daily, weekly, and monthly schedule. Effortlessly used on surfaces such as your bedroom wall, kitchen fridge, college dorm, work desk, or family room to help maximize organization. PERFECT FOR ANYONE - This erasable custom dry-erase chalkboard decal can be used by anyone, from small kids to adults. You can stay on task and organized with this dryerase black board decor sticker! Easy and stress free to use; simply peel, stick, then write & wipe with a wet erase liquid chalk marker! Removable and reusable to create multiple easily modified schedules with the affordable decal in your home, office, or classroom. PERFORMANCE & SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - Unlike cheaper counterparts, Evolve Skins is proudly designed and printed in USA. We are dedicated to your satisfaction. If you are ever not satisfied with the performance of your product simply let us know and we’ll give you a 100% refund, no questions asked! Get your black artisanal chart now! Simply click \"ADD TO CART\" and \"CHECKOUT\". It is a small investment that will deliver tremendous benefits! POPULAR GIFT FOR ANYONE & ALL OCCASIONS - Lend a helping hand to your friends, family, college classmates, or teacher by giving them the gift of this large non-magnetic artisinal calendar planner. Make your next visit a surprise so start stocking up on the perfect gift for the holidays for; professionals, boss, CEO, coworker, colleague, partner, parents, moms, dads, teachers, students, him, her, daycares, baby sitters, etc! SIMPLY UNBEATABLE - Highest grade vinyl with a finishing coat of lamination. You do not need to stress about choosing between quality and price. This planner offers trouble-free performance and easily erases with a touch of water. It is made for sticking to surfaces without leaving sticky residue when removed unlike other cheap, flimsy dry erase weekly planners that bubbles, stains and falls off your walls. There is no comparison","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613nSM6jJ8L._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lushleaf Designs","source_asin":"B016AXOKRE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016AXOKRE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016AXOKRE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":225416,"name":"Handmade Swedish Tomte Wine Tube- Christmas Santa Claus Round Wine Tote Bottle Carrier Box-Home Holiday Decoration - Holiday Wine Gift Package Box, Re","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ey2imGBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT HOLIDAY GIFTS --- This wine box gnome is an adorable gift perfect to say Merry Christmas! It makes the ideal wine gift box for gifting a bottle to friends, family or anyone else with whom you want to share a special bottle. There's no reason why these cuties can't be used for candy and other gifts too! The amazing box is a perfect gift for holidays, dinners, Chrisrmas parties, events & all occasions! A LUCKY GNOME --- Gnome or Tomte, according to Scandinavian folklore, he is elderly, with a long beard. The Tomte is reputed to safeguard the farms, family and children, particularly at night, protecting them from misfortune. Gnomes is best known for guarding Earthly treasures and is perfect for protecting your Christmas goodies and adding some whimsy to your holiday decor. DIMENSION --- The gnome's body is 12in height and his cap is 13 in. Diameter: 3.15 in/8 cm. He fits a standard bottle of wine/champagne Bottle with diameter about 7.5cm. 25 inch tall from bottom to top of hat. Rope handle box, easy to hold. MATERIAL --- The gnomes body is crafted from cardboard paper and fabric. He wore a new cloth to celebrate the Christmas Day. His hat is crafted from red soft felt and the nose is made with resin. The long white beard is made of fiber fur and a wire in his ridiculously tall hat and arms in order to pose it for maximum whimsy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ey2imGBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ITOMTE","source_asin":"B07588HTRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07588HTRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07588HTRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
