window.products.push({"id":225539,"name":"Kitchen mats for Floor Nonazippy [2 PCS] Kitchen Rugs Set，Kitchen Floor mats Cushioned Anti Fatigue，(17 x 47 +17 x 29 in) Set Kitchen Floor Mats Cushi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O4keaSVHL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Anti-Fatigue: Nonazippy Extra Thick Anti-Fatigue Kitchen Mats are ergonomically designed to provide cushioned support to help improve circulation and posture while working in the kitchen or any workstation. The patterns and colors are simple and elegant, and match perfectly with the kitchen/room color, making the foam pads ideal for home or commercial use, such as hair salons, restaurants, etc. that require long periods of standing. PREMIUM MATERIALS: Our kitchen stand pads are made from one piece PVC molding, the set contains 2 rectangular pads (17.3 x 47 inches and 17.3 x 29 inches). Nonazippy kitchen mats are made of high quality PVC material and are phthalate free. Eco-friendly pads are made with high-quality strength materials to ensure that the pads retain their shape even with prolonged and heavy use. Easy to clean: does not collect dirt. The material is resistant to water, liquids, oil or stains and can be easily cleaned up if there is any spillage. If necessary, simply wipe with a damp cloth or use a hand-held vacuum. MULTIPLE USES: Nonazippy Anti-Fatigue Mats provide extra large area for standing in laundry rooms, kitchens, offices, farmhouses, in front of the sink or any other high traffic indoor or outdoor space. Neutral colors go perfectly with any decor. Also a great gift for Thanksgiving, Christmas or any other holiday! Instructions for use! ! ! : Make sure the floor is clean and dry before use. Water under the carpet can cause slippage. Since the Nonazippy kitchen mat is rolled, small wrinkles may appear when opened. do not worry! Just leave it on the ground for a few days and it will be smooth and fluffy. I believe the product will continue to be used, if you have any questions, please contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O4keaSVHL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nonazippy","source_asin":"B0C2CPQBRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2CPQBRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2CPQBRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
