window.products.push({"id":225605,"name":"Evron Wall Mount Corner Shelf,Easy to Install Metal Front Floating Corner Shelf with Self-Adhesive Tapes,Wood Imitation Corner Shelves with Wire Pass ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Potifg98L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A good fixture to give your room more life with your art boutiques and favorite decoration. Adding corner shelves allow you to have freedom to get your favorite stuffs into well organized state and store your items into your right ways. No sharpen edge design avoids accidentally scratch to human body or pets. it is entirely safely and suitable to be placed into living room,dining room,toilet, bathroom or kitchen. Each wall shelf has a area of around 378 square cm and is more than enough to display books, CD, plant terrarium, photo frame and etc. Any dust or dirt can easily be cleaned by wiping with a piece of cloth. Easy to assemble and install: Installation Method (A) Need to drill holes for mounting the shelf.  A1. Select the suitable height of the wall corner, keep the shelf sides clinging to the wall corner and parallel the shelf surface with the ground , use pencil to mark 4 positions clearly on the wall.  A2. Use the 6mm drill bit to drill 4 holes on the pencil marks, use a hammer to impact the plastic expansion pipes into the 4 wall holes. A3. Tighten the 4 screws with a screwdriver, while tightening the screws in halfway, make sure to place the shelf in the position of the screw mount followed by lock the screws tightly. Installation method (B) Self-adhesive installation, no drilling requires. B1. Select the appropriate position and height, clean the wall, make sure that you have properly located the right position before take off the protective layer, Once applied the self-adhesive tapes on the wall, it is used permanently. B2. Make sure that the screw mount position on the shelf and the screw on the adhesive tape is to fit one into the other. B3. Lock screws tightly. Note: cementitious mortar surface,wall paper, latex paint surface will affect the loading capacity, it might leave marks on the the wall surface when remove the adhesive tape.avoid expose to sunshine directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Potifg98L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"evron","source_asin":"B07XL3NLJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XL3NLJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XL3NLJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
