window.products.push({"id":225638,"name":"ZAMAT Contour Memory Foam Pillow for Neck Pain Relief, Adjustable Ergonomic Cervical Pillow for Sleeping, Orthopedic Neck Pillow with Washable Cover, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71txwKm2P3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[CUT DOWN ON SLEEPLESS NIGHTS WITH THIS SUPPORTIVE PILLOW]: If you've recently had time to complain about morning NECK PAINS as a result of your sleep, then you might want to consider the ZAMAT contour pillow. This contoured cervical pillow is designed to cradle the natural curvature of your neck, provides incredible support for spine alignment, and is guaranteed to never have you waking up with any shoulder, back, spine, nor neck pain again. [ODORLESS MEMORY FOAM, SLEEP QUALITY ENSURED]: If you're sensitive to the smell of memory foam pillow's off-gassing or just want something all-natural, this contour sleeping pillow is a must-have! It is ergonomically-sound and made with high-quality odorless memory foam that is CertiPUR-US certified in order to give you solid support when you're on your side, back, or stomach, while the memory foam material conforms to your body so you wake up pain-free! [ADJUSTABLE DESIGN, EASY TO CUSTOMIZE]: For neck pain sufferers, the shape of pillow is neither too high nor too low, so our adjustable neck pillow is a great option. The orthopedic pillow contains an REMOVABLE MEMORY FOAM PAD (about 0.8\" thick). To change the loft, simply unzip the pillow, add or remove the fill from the main chamber. Additionally, if it too thin for you, please reach to us for an EXTRA MEMORY FOAM PAD. For low pillow sleepers, rotating the pillow 360° will meet your needs. [REMOVABLE & WASHABLE PILLOWCASE]: The pillow's medium feel creates a comfortable balance of pressure relief and support, while the quilted cover adds some additional comfort and breathability. Built with double pillowcases, the outer cover made of moisture-wicking bamboo and polyester that's machine-washable for easy cleaning, the stretchy polyester liner helps the pillow hold its shape, and perfect for keeping you cool throughout the night. NOTE: THE MEMORY FOAM SHOULD NEVER BE LAUNDERED. [WORRY FREE WITH 100% SATISFACTION]: Finding a great ergonomic pillow that can help reduce your neck problems is an efficient way to improve your sleep each night. We can guarantee that you will not be disappointed considering the many outstanding features it has to offer. We provide a 100% satisfaction solution in the rare case you do not enjoy the product, if you need any assistance, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71txwKm2P3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZAMAT","source_asin":"B0C1VLVKQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1VLVKQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1VLVKQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
