window.products.push({"id":225691,"name":"Round Cotton Trivets Set of 4 in Black by Beets & Berry, 7 inch and 9 inch Diameter, Pot Holders, Hot Pads, Hot Mats, 100% Pure Eco Cotton, Boho, Farm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917r1qQokwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROTECT YOUR TABLES & COUNTERTOPS: Our Trivets, Pot Holders, Hot Pad Pot Mats, and Placemats for Hot Dishes and Plates are heat resistant allowing you to safely protect your countertops, kitchen and dining room table surfaces from Hot Pans, Pots, Cast Iron Skillets, Coffee Tea Pots, and Hot Dishes with our Trivets for Pots and Pans and Placemats for Plates and Bowls. Stone, Wood, Granite, Tile, Quartz Countertop - they’ll all be 100% safe from the heat of your hot dishes. UPGRADE IN STYLE: Your kitchen decor will look incredible with these in-trend 100% Eco Cotton Thread Woven Kitchen Trivet and Placemats. Even when not in use, the rustic farmhouse decor design will elevate the feel and look of your kitchen. Our uniquely themed & custom design and color combinations will provide flair and mid century modern sophistication so you can confidently impress hosting your next dinner party or event. Each piece is individual and unique! COLORS: Available in three beautiful and simple color choices. Touch of Glam offers a blend of boho and rustic farmhouse with tones of browns, blacks, whites, and gray.. If a more classic mid century modern look is what you crave, our black and beige color options will bring sophistication and class without overtaking the space. SIZES THAT ARE VERSATILE: Our four Hot Pad Trivet Pot Mats include two 7 inch diameter trivets and two 9 inch diameter trivets. Our four Placemats include four 13 inch diameter placemats ideal for large plates for dining. They protect your surfaces from heat and moisture while elevating both your space and the presentation of your dishes. Our trivets can serve as small placemats while our placemats can serve as trivets for EXTRA LARGE dishes. THE PERFECT GIFT: Every kitchen needs Hot Pad Trivet Pot Holders and Placemats. That makes Beets & Berry the perfect Bridal Shower gift, Hostess gift, Birthday gift, Mother's Day Gift, Holiday Gift, Christmas Gift, Housewarming Gift for your Wife, Mother, Grandma, Sister, Daughter, Friend and more! GUARANTEE: Love these boho trivets and placemats or your money back. No questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917r1qQokwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"beets&berry","source_asin":"B09V1V1SYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V1V1SYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V1V1SYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":225692,"name":"DASH Compact Electric Air Fryer + Oven Cooker with Digital Display, Temperature Control, Non Stick Fry Basket, Recipe Guide + Auto Shut Off Feature, 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713EIewVNbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy your favorite fried foods without the guilt when using the DASH digital compact air fryer. Air rapidly circulates to cook ingredients and keep the signature crispy quality of fried foods, while eliminating the need for oil. Air frying reduces added fat by 70-80% without sacrificing flavor.the DASH digital compact air fryer is a healthier way to fry and a cleaner way to cook. With 5 preset functions including poultry, steak, baked goods, fresh fries, and frozen fries, the digital compact air fryer is designed to make your meals and snacks healthier and easier to prepare. A manual function allows you to have even more control over air frying your ingredients. The digital display allows for you to see exactly how much time is left and to conveniently manipulate the temperature settings. Simply plug in your air fryer, set the desired time and temperature or choose your function, and you’re ready to air fry! the compact design fits neatly on your countertop, while offering an ample 1.6 quart Capacity. The nonstick interior is convenient for wiping down and eliminating buildup, while dishwasher safe parts make the appliance easy to clean. Air fry sweet potato fries, spicy chicken wings, or a gluten-free flourless chocolate cake–the DASH digital compact air fryer can do it all.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713EIewVNbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DASH","source_asin":"B07P163LL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P163LL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P163LL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
