window.products.push({"id":225775,"name":"Magic Mill Slow cooker/Sous vide (Sous Vide)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818auX7e-rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is Sous vide? Sous vide has long been a popular cooking method with professional chefs. “Sous vide” is French for “under vacuum”. It describes a cooking method in which food is placed in sealed vacuum bags and cooked in a water bath. The food is cooked at a constant low temperature over a long time to make it moist and flavorful. The Magic Mill countertop Sous Vide offers you to create restaurant quality food at home, a cooking convenience which you have looking for. The Magic Mill makes it easy to have meals ready without hassle. Using the Magic Mill SousVide, everyone - from the accomplished cook to the rank novice - can turn out gourmet quality meals with minimal preparation time. Why Magic Mill sous vide: Features: Sleek all-in-one design Temperature range of 115-195 °F in increments of 1 °F. Quiet operation Push button simplicity Lid can be used as a drip tray for pouch transport Universal food pouch rack for easy positioning of cooking pouches and kitchen tong Auto shutoff when cooking time is done More sous vide benefits : ☑ Hands-off, time-saving meal preparation. Just set it and walk away.  ☑ Easy and foolproof. Never overcook a meal again. Perfect results, every time. even delicate foods like salmon can be cooked for hours, leaving ample time for flavors to penetrate  ☑ Gourmet taste. Capture the full, true flavor of foods. ☑ Saves you money. Tenderizes inexpensive cuts.  ☑ Added nutritional value. Natural juices and nutrients are retained in the food-safe vacuum seal bag. ☑ Easy clean-up. No messy pots and pans. Just empty and wipe down the interior with a soft cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818auX7e-rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magic Mill","source_asin":"B01MRRGX15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRRGX15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRRGX15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
