window.products.push({"id":225810,"name":"YENMEEN 3D Succulent Pillow,Cactus Decor Throw Pillow, Cute Plush Leaf Pillow for Couch Sofa Living Room & Home Decor, Great Gift for Succulents Plant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LJ8OdXP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a 3D succulent plants throw pillow with miniature plush. Comfortable feel, is super soft, its packaged in a vacuum-packed box,  when you open the package,it will fluff up quickly, you will enjoy the touch, it will be a great and interesting  addition to your sofa accessories. Home decor: Add a pop of green life into your living room, bedroom, reading corner, photoshoot spot, or anywhere else! Use our succulent pillow as a headrest or cuddle buddy when watching TV or relaxing. Decorate your  living room, or bedroom with a pop of life. Ready for gifting: make a wonderful new home gift with our Succulent Leaf Throw Pillow. Note: Due to the different monitor and light effects, the actual color of the plush pillow might be slightly different from the color shown in the pictures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LJ8OdXP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YENMEEN","source_asin":"B0B25S7LZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B25S7LZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B25S7LZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":225811,"name":"Entertaining with Caspari Cocktail Napkin, Vintage Quilt Blue, 20-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DU-kQ2WrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Entertaining with Caspari Vintage Quilt Cocktail Napkin, Pack Of 20. Adapt the elegance of a formal table setting to everyday life with our luxury paper plates and napkins. Printed in Germany using non-toxic, water-soluble dyes on the softest three-ply tissue printable, these paper cocktail napkins have the feel of linen without the maintenance. Disposability means less time spent on clean-up and more time with friends and family. They are 100-percent biodegradable and compostable, combining convenience with sustainability. This pack contains 20 napkins, each measuring 5-Inch square folded and 10-Inch square open. Caspari - bringing style and convenience into your home every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DU-kQ2WrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caspari","source_asin":"B01AHL0YM0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AHL0YM0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AHL0YM0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":225812,"name":"3 Pcs Coffee Latte Art Pen Stainless Steel Tool Espresso Machine Cafe Home Kitchen for Latte Art use by PPX","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61meG0t2jTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✤100% Brand New And High Quality Espresso Art Pen  ✤Professional Latte Art Tool To Shape Beautiful Coffee Pattern  ✤Coffee Art Pen Made Of Stainless Steel Material  ✤Necessary tool for a cup of decious coffee. Specification: Material: 304 Stainless Steel Espresso Art Pen  Size:5.3\"(13.5 cm)  Color: Silver PPX Package include: 3 X Coffee Art Pen A man and his wife were having an argument about who should brew the coffee each morning. The wife said, “You should do it, because you get up first, and then we don’t have to wait as long to get our coffee”. The husband said, “You are in charge of the cooking around here and you should do it, because that is your job, and I can just wait for my coffee.” Wife replied, “No, you should do it, and besides it is in the Bible that the man should do the coffee.” Husband said, “I can’t believe that, show me.” So she fetched the bible, and opened the New Testament and showed him at the top of several pages, that it indeed says: “HEBREWS”. Now let's cut to the chase- Let's brew the coffee.(Come and buy at PPX Online) Please do not hesitate to contact PPX Online Team if there is any question.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61meG0t2jTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PPX","source_asin":"B07KXGRB75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KXGRB75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KXGRB75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":225813,"name":"WOODERFUL LIFE Static Musical Box Wooden | Love Letter | 1030850 | Exquisite Full of Details Hand Painted Hand Carved Romantic Gift | Plays - Minuet N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IcvoLQraL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRAND: Wooderful life is a Taiwan brand that specializes in wooden music boxes, home accessories and wooden crafts. The brand name combines the words of \"wood\", \"wonderful\" and \"life\". Every single piece of wooden craft from Wooderful life is designed creatively and aesthetically to complement your lifestyle. CORE MOVEMENT: Inheriting the legacy of precise manufacturing skills from Japan, the handmade movements are a sophisticated musical instrument driven by mechanical vibration. Each of them is tested manually with strict standards to achieve the perfect melody. DESIGN: Wooden music box design was coming from the base of physical dynamics and magnets and run in different fun movements including different way of 360 degrees rotation, up and down movement, swaying, some product with small magnetic cars and trains. From design concepts, sketches, prototyping, modify mechanical construction to mass production, 60 full-time designers and thousands of factory employees work together to present the best works. CRAFT: Cherishing the best natural gift-wood from nature, we are dedicated to innovating techniques and constantly optimizing processes. Each music box has dozens to hundreds small parts and goes through at least 20 processes to be finished. The processes include lathe, mill, drill, modeling, cut, polishing, metal stamping, laser, oil spray, hand painting, pad printing, resin, injection molding, etc, it combines both efficient manufacturing process and unrepeatable handcraft techniques. SUSTAINABLE FOREST PRODUCTS: Selecting of premium hardwoods from legal sources, the wood of Wooderful life mainly comes from Northern America well managed forestry supply chain. Each piece of wood has its unique texture. The warm touching of Wooderful life music box will bring you to get close to nature and listen to the story of forest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IcvoLQraL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOODERFUL LIFE","source_asin":"B08R9GS21Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R9GS21Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R9GS21Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
