window.products.push({"id":225820,"name":"Isaac Jacobs 2-Pack Large Clear Storage Bins (11.5” L x 14” W x 5.5” H) w/Cutout Handles, Plastic Organizer for Home, Office, Kitchen, Fridge/Freezer,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fepz-Nn2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HOME ORGANIZATION: These Isaac Jacobs large clear storage bins come in a matching 2-piece set and can help get rid of clutter throughout the home. Each large bin is a see-through, space-saving solution that can be put to good use in the bathroom, kitchen, bedroom, garage, laundry room, or home office. Your everyday essentials, makeup tools, school supplies, snacks, and food items can all be stored away neatly in these handy bins that will save counterspace and help keep your desk clean. CLEAR DESIGN: Staying organized is easy with these modern, clear plastic bins. The cutout handles make it easy to hold and carry from room to room. The transparent design of each bin enables you to quickly see what’s stored in each container; ideal for when you’re on-the-go. These modern bins are designed to blend into the décor of any room while cleaning up the mess on your desk, closet shelves, counterspace and tabletops. [Dimensions of each bin: 11.5” L x 14” W x 5.5” H] MULTI-PURPOSE: Utilize this clear container to store items throughout the home and bring organization to the areas you use most. Place them on floating shelves, or on a countertop and you can maximize storage space in the kitchen. Fill it with pens, pencils, markers, and sticky notes and maintain order on your child’s desk or play table. Store it on a craft table and arrange buttons, glue sticks, and stickers; or organize a bedroom closet by filling it with head bands, scarves, or gloves. MULTIFUNCTIONAL: You may not even realize how essential these storage bins are until you see one in the refrigerator. Free up space in your product drawers by placing both bins on a shelf. Arrange cheese in one bin, along with jams, nut butter spreads. fruits, veggies, or yogurt and juice pouches in another. These bins are ideal size to store child-size snack bags and de-clutter cabinet space. Put two under a bathroom sink to separate grooming items and toiletries from cleaning supplies. EASY STORAGE: These see-through storage bins are ideally sized to fit on any counter space and are excellent containers for tidying up your workspace, or for holding a toddler’s small toys and blocks. Whether you use one bin in multiple rooms, or all both bins in one place, you’ll be glad you have these multi-purpose bins. Check out our other clear bin sizes to fit all your storage needs. All bins are leak-proof and can be easily cleaned with soap and water. [DO NOT USE IN DISHWASHER]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fepz-Nn2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B09LZ8MFSN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LZ8MFSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LZ8MFSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
