window.products.push({"id":225851,"name":"Venustas Wearable Blanket Hoodie, Oversized Sherpa Hooded Blanket Sweatshirt, Super Warm and Cozy Hoodie Blanket for Women Men Adults","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rRDekNCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sherpa Imported Fluffy Wearable Blanket: Venustas wearable blanket hoodie keeps you warm & cozy while you are lounging, watching TV, reading, enjoying sporting events, etc. The oversized hoodie is suitable for outdoor activities, soft & comfortable. You can wear the big hood and pull your legs into the plush hoodie blanket easily to cover yourself completely, which keeps you warm in cold. Luxury Sherpa Material & Elaborate Design: Wearable blanket hoodie is made from two layers of cozy and soft fabrics, snuggle and warm. There is a huge front pocket to hide the TV remote, snacks, phone, and game controller. The oversized sherpa hoodie can cater to all wearers, whether you plan a Netflix marathon or want to go about your daily tasks feeling snug and toasty with a few distinct designs. Convenient Wearable Blanket: Venustas warm blanket hoodie is a great accessory to have when you are cold-sensitive or just want to up that coziness factor in the colder season. The blanket sweatshirt will feel like a warm embrace. You don't have to crank up the heat to get toasty and warm when the temperatures drop. Oversized Hoodie's Size Fits All: The hooded blanket suits people of all sizes, women and men, indoors and outdoors. Bring it to the next outdoor barbeque, camping trip, beach, drive-in, or sleepover. It is an ideal gift choice for Father's day, Mother's Day, Christmas, Easter, Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, New Year's Eve, birthdays, etc. Machine-wash Wearable Blanket: Venustas sherpa hoodie is machine washable and can be tumble-dried. Washing? Easy! Just toss in the wash on cold then tumble dry separately on a low. Your wearable blanket will smell divine and look just as new whenever you want it to! And that saves you a lot of work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rRDekNCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Venustas","source_asin":"B0B4DM7B8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4DM7B8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4DM7B8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
