window.products.push({"id":225853,"name":"Hamburger Press Patty Maker, 3 in 1 Non-Stick Burger Press for Making Delicious Burgers, Perfect Shaped Patties, for grilling and cooking, with 40 PCS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715pNpg5d0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to use】In a few quick steps you can have a customised burger ready to grill for friends and family. Just 3 steps, put the meat and squeeze first, then Put the your stuffings (Use anything from cheese, to bacon, to sauce, to mac and cheese.) , and finally seal ! Add anything as you want! Once the burger is sealed, You can pop the non-stick bottom directly by hand, so you can easily take out the perfect round noodle hamburger without getting stick. 【Size does matter】: This Burger press will help you make round hamburger puddings of different sizes and thicknesses. The small base at the top is for mini hamburger patties and sliders, the detachable press helps you create filling wells, and the large base at the bottom is suitable for large or filled hamburger patties. 【Detachable & Non-stick coating】: The bottom of this burger press has a special Non-Stick Coating for preventing stick , so you can easily get your perfectly beef patty. If you run into problems with the meat sticking to your burger press, we find that adding a bit of olive oil, or using wax paper between the meat and the press works perfectly ! This Package includes 40 pieces free burger paper, could help preventing the finished burger meatloaf sticking. 【Dishwasher safe】: Hamburger patty maker is made of high-quality food-grade BPA-free ABS plastics, all parts are detachable, it is easy to clean and can be cleaned with dish soap and water, supports dishwasher cleaning. In order to keep a long time use, we suggest wash this burger press after use. 【BBQ Party】With this Burger Press, it’s easier than ever to make a variety of delicious burgers. Imagine hosting a fun burger-bar using creative ingredients so guests can make their own unique taste sensations. Try Hawaiian burgers, chicken Cordon Bleu burgers, chili burgers, pizza burgers, Mexican burgers, Reuben burgers, or Buffalo chicken burgers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715pNpg5d0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUANG ZHIZHUO","source_asin":"B08VJBKC6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VJBKC6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VJBKC6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
