window.products.push({"id":225882,"name":"ALIPOBO Kids Apron and Chef Hat Set, Children's Adjustable Bib Apron with 2 Pockets. Cute Boys Girls Kitchen Apron for Cooking, Baking, Painting, Trai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HT5EsznuL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description: The kids bib apron with 2 spacious pockets presents the most temperate and helpful cooking experience. Made of premium polyester fabric, this child cooking apron and chef hat set free from harmful chemicals, safe for your kids and your family. With an adjustable neck strap and the chef hat, which hided an adjustable elastic band, this thoughtful chef hat apron set can be easily suitable for most boys and girls. Product Specification: Material: High density PolyesterChef hat size: 10.2” x 7.2”Apron size: Small: 19.7\" x 17.7\" (Age 2-5 years), Large: 23.6\"x19.7\" (Age 6-12 years) Package included: 1 x Kids Apron; 1 x Child chef hat; 1 x Beautiful Packaging. Washing and care Instructions: Always use cold water to wash the apron. Bleaching, dry cleaning is NOT allowed. Wash with like colors. Do not use fabric softener. Clothes dryer is NOT recommended. Tumble dry on low heat. Iron on low heat. Broad Use: If your kids are not only using the chef hat apron set for cooking, just rest assure that they are going to protect your children’ s clothes from paint spots, food residue or other forms of dirt. It’s also suitable for the following:Cooking: Smart chef, baker, helper, etc.Art and Craft: Painting, training, gardening, etc.Meanwhile, this cute kids apron and chef hat set is suitable for any types of cooking birthday parties, painting parties, Christmas and New Year parties. Click the ”Add to Cart” button . Your Little Helper needs an adorable apron and matching chef hat to bake / cook up all those goodies or to make their artistic creations. Let your children feel free doing their activities - Choose ALIPOBO kids aprons for any kind activities in kitchen, classroom, arts, crafts, garden, house or just for fun time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HT5EsznuL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALIPOBO","source_asin":"B091C84849","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091C84849","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091C84849","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
