window.products.push({"id":225939,"name":"Braun Electric Hand Mixer, 9-Speed, 350W, Lightweight with Soft Anti-Slip Handle, Accessories to Beat & Whisk (Multi-Whisk), Dough Hooks to Knead & 2-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R3YjM1AaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beat, whisk, knead and even chop all the ingredients that go into your favorite recipes with the multimix 5 hand mixer, model HM5130. A 350-watt motor delivers 50% more power* than leading competitors to combine even the toughest ingredients for well-mixed results. Smartmix technology incorporates an in-line vertical motor design that redistributes the weight of the mixer out of your hand and into the bowl, requiring 50% less effort* for mixing. The completely sealed system and sleek design has no open ventilation slots, so nothing can get inside the housing, making cleaning quick and easy, resulting in long-lasting performance. With 9 speeds to choose from — and Turbo for the toughest jobs — a simple turn of the variocontrol speed dial with your thumb is all it takes to seamlessly fine-tune the speed for precise mixing results. No need to stop and change attachments to go from whisking to beating. The unique multi whisk attachment is both whisk and beater in one. Its dual-action design creates volume for light, airy mixtures. Ready to bake some bread? this powerful mixer and included dough hooks are up to the task. And the versatile chopper attachment lets you prep ingredients as the perfect mix-in or topping to your creation. With the signature Braun design and engineering, this lightweight hand mixer with soft-grip handle is slip-resistant, keeping you comfortably in control. All that's left to do is UNPLUG the extra-long cord, pack the pieces into the accessory storage bag and let the baking begin. *Wattage and mixing effort (mixing cake batter, external tests) compared to leading competitors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R3YjM1AaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Braun","source_asin":"B0C2YKLNZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2YKLNZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2YKLNZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":225940,"name":"Bride Tribe Hair Tie Cards. to Have and to Hold, Your Hair Back. Help Me Tie The Knot. Bachelorette, Wedding Shower, Party Favors for Bridesmaids (Pac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xIC7OH9SL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Add a little craziness to your celebrations with the Bachelorette to Bride range from party supplies company Life is a Party. These elasticated hair ties are 0.6\" x 3.75\" (1.5cm x 9.5cm) when on their card. (Circumference is 5.9\" (15cm), excluding knot.) The cards measure 3.1\" x 3.1\" (7.8cm x 7.8cm). Each 12-pack contains 12 cards, each with 2 elasticated hair ties for a total of 24 hair ties. Each 6-pack contains 6 cards, each with 2 elasticated hair ties for a total of 12 hair ties. Guaranteed to light up your event, day or night. Stocks are limited. Order today or risk missing out!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xIC7OH9SL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bachelorette to Bride","source_asin":"B09K5J5BFQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K5J5BFQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K5J5BFQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
