window.products.push({"id":225948,"name":"Popcorn Machine, 6-Quart Popcorn Popper maker, Nonstick Plate, Electric Stirring with Quick-Heat Technology, Cool Touch Handles (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AWPnEY7sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"POPCORN TIME: Yabano popcorn machine can make 6 quarts of popcorn at once to supply the whole family, you can enjoy happy popcorn time at home. Quick-heat technology allows popcorn to pop 40% faster than traditional stirring popcorn makers - no preheating, no waiting! ELECTRIC STIRRING: The motorized stirring rod ensures that the popcorn is heated evenly, resulting in better popping performance and increased popcorn pops rate. The popcorn can reach up to 100% of the corn you put in, resulting in crisp popcorn that pops but doesn't burn. HEALTHIER AND MORE FLAVORSOME: With no preservatives, hot and fresh popcorn can help promote a healthier lifestyle. You can make chocolate popcorn, butter popcorn, salty popcorn, and any other flavors or roasted nuts as you desire. REMOVABLE AND EASY TO CLEAN: The removable non-stick popping plate can be easily cleaned by wiping it gently, and the 2-in-1 transparent cover can also be used as a serving bowl. Both of these parts are dishwasher safe, making cleaning a breeze. SPECIAL DESIGN: The vent holes design can prevent steam or condensation buildup in the clear lid, ensuring that the popcorn stays crispy. The cool-touch handles design can prevent scalding when you invert the popping plate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AWPnEY7sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yabano","source_asin":"B0952RJ35K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-225948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0952RJ35K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0952RJ35K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
